[l_english.MODULE_PROJECTILE_4C_PETRIFIED]
Petrified Dessert

[l_english.MODULE_PROJECTILE_4C_PETRIFIED_desc]
A weapon first invented by Trixie, this deceptive weapon is usually not dodged as quickly as a stone when the enemy sees a cake pouring down.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PROJECTILE_4C_PETRIFIED]
石化点心

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PROJECTILE_4C_PETRIFIED_desc]
最早由特丽克西发明的一种具有欺骗性的武器：当敌军看到蛋糕倾泻而来的时候，通常不会像看到石头那样迅速躲避。
